  "question": {
    "text": "Four parallel large plates separated by equal distance <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math> are arranged as shown. The area of the plate is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>. Find the potential difference between the plates <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> if the plate <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is given charge <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math>.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image112-54c1f7db-8e3e-4644-9d60-d88c51713bc0.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 109px; width: 250px;\" />",
