  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Treat parallel plates as capacitor and then make potential difference zero from A to D by assuming some charge on each plate .<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image113-a5dbaf57-f661-482c-8e12-f27d707ac286.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" /><br /><br /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
